    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/bc8fd51cc58f85873a082122fe60aa77.avif?t=1755089848\" width=614 height=400 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/a1b60bd3fbbd07f9868b05285f8de3ca.avif?t=1755089848\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kick brains, wolves, skeletons, ... Kick EVERYTHING! </strong>Kick'n Hell is<i>\u00a0</i>a wild, unforgiving 3D precision platformer where your only weapon is your <i>mighty foot</i>. Kick brains as you parkour your way through the depths of Hell on a mission to defeat Satan. Every kick sends you flying, every mistake can cost you dearly. You'll need precision, skill, and a whole lot of patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/0aa4256870f00d49aecc232bf5a8d6b2.poster.avif?t=1755089848\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/0aa4256870f00d49aecc232bf5a8d6b2.webm?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/0aa4256870f00d49aecc232bf5a8d6b2.mp4?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/ebba0844ee36b28485c05ad511ad623a.avif?t=1755089848\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail a jump, the risk exists that you fall all the way back down. This means you will have to start the stage again, because hell is a place of suffering. Sometimes it is smarter to take your time for a jump, rather than rushing the level. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/25a5cf09d1af69ae8863b9b38c3de27a.poster.avif?t=1755089848\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/25a5cf09d1af69ae8863b9b38c3de27a.webm?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/25a5cf09d1af69ae8863b9b38c3de27a.mp4?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/e2aa223dccfdabe06c2b990ea587b97b.avif?t=1755089848\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game harnesses Chi-energy. Collect all of them to learn the traits of a true martial artist. This is your ultimate test after all!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/876767323ffbbf01f1486852d6289d1c.poster.avif?t=1755089848\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/876767323ffbbf01f1486852d6289d1c.webm?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/876767323ffbbf01f1486852d6289d1c.mp4?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove that you are the ultimate martial artist and go kick Satan in his face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/4131f71534a0ba0d05fe84968f2c7ccf.poster.avif?t=1755089848\" width=450 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/4131f71534a0ba0d05fe84968f2c7ccf.webm?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/4131f71534a0ba0d05fe84968f2c7ccf.mp4?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/a1b60bd3fbbd07f9868b05285f8de3ca.avif?t=1755089848\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kick brains, wolves, skeletons, ... Kick EVERYTHING! </strong>Kick'n Hell is<i>\u00a0</i>a wild, unforgiving 3D precision platformer where your only weapon is your <i>mighty foot</i>. Kick brains as you parkour your way through the depths of Hell on a mission to defeat Satan. Every kick sends you flying, every mistake can cost you dearly. You'll need precision, skill, and a whole lot of patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/0aa4256870f00d49aecc232bf5a8d6b2.poster.avif?t=1755089848\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/0aa4256870f00d49aecc232bf5a8d6b2.webm?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/0aa4256870f00d49aecc232bf5a8d6b2.mp4?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/ebba0844ee36b28485c05ad511ad623a.avif?t=1755089848\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail a jump, the risk exists that you fall all the way back down. This means you will have to start the stage again, because hell is a place of suffering. Sometimes it is smarter to take your time for a jump, rather than rushing the level. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/25a5cf09d1af69ae8863b9b38c3de27a.poster.avif?t=1755089848\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/25a5cf09d1af69ae8863b9b38c3de27a.webm?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/25a5cf09d1af69ae8863b9b38c3de27a.mp4?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/e2aa223dccfdabe06c2b990ea587b97b.avif?t=1755089848\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game harnesses Chi-energy. Collect all of them to learn the traits of a true martial artist. This is your ultimate test after all!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/876767323ffbbf01f1486852d6289d1c.poster.avif?t=1755089848\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/876767323ffbbf01f1486852d6289d1c.webm?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/876767323ffbbf01f1486852d6289d1c.mp4?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove that you are the ultimate martial artist and go kick Satan in his face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/4131f71534a0ba0d05fe84968f2c7ccf.poster.avif?t=1755089848\" width=450 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/4131f71534a0ba0d05fe84968f2c7ccf.webm?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832070/extras/4131f71534a0ba0d05fe84968f2c7ccf.mp4?t=1755089848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Kick, climb, fall, rage\u2026 Rise to the top and take on Satan, or fall like the rest. Beware, there\u2019s no mercy in Hell.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cKick\u2019n Hell may just have the most unique and interesting movement I\u2019ve ever experienced. Using kicks to throw myself across the sprawling environments was one of the most fun &amp; frustrating mechanics I\u2019ve experienced this year.\u201d<br>Screen Hype<br><br>\u201cKick \u2018n Hell isn\u2019t for the faint of heart. It\u2019s a brutally difficult challenge that requires you to bring your A-game. An interesting concept that\u2019s executed extremely well,\u201d<br>VICE<br><br>\u201cKick'n Hell is the kind of game speedrunners will not only fall in love with, but most likely marry and move to Hawaii with as well. Well, if Hawaii were on fire, and they had to kick all the coconuts,\u201d<br>Finger Guns<br>",
